@startuml
' Figure 23.1  The letter that tried to instruct
' Reading order: top to bottom. The red-team letter rt-letter-07 asks
' for a refund to a new card ending 7731. Through the edge, the
' proposal carries the locator and amount only and the gateway takes
' card 0952 from the record. With the edge skipped, the proposal
' carries 7731 and no approval, and the gateway refuses it.
' From inputs.demo --part letter, with and without the injection.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Letter" as L <<knowledge>>
participant "Edge" as E <<policy>>
participant "Agent" as A <<model>>
participant "Gateway" as G <<policy>>
L -> E : letter
E -> A : fields, flag
A -> G : refund 312.40
G -> G : card 0952
== edge skipped ==
L -[$FAIL]> A : raw text
A -> G : card 7731
G -[$FAIL]> A : refused
@enduml
